utcome; new undesired[6] plan in a spec-less or research-only folder, or the rule leaking to other types). Both Research no / Strategy no. Awaiting the user's confirmation. (e) Note: the tool help text for aide_validate in src/index.ts still defines orphaned specs as "in folders with no orchestrator" — update with the build. (f) The aidemd.dev headless sync to 0.12.1 succeeded: serverVersion 0.12.1; applied pointer-stub (CLAUDE.md), methodology-docs (8 updated + changelog.md created), commands (5), agents (7 updated + aide-upgrader created), skills (2), version-metadata; ide/readme/mcp matched; brain untouched; site commit 835109a pushed to main; brainMigration null. BUT the site's GitHub Pages deploy run (40336209154) FAILED at "Install Playwright browsers": GitHub's ubuntu-latest moved to Ubuntu 26.04 (from 2026-10-19) and Playwright 1.59.1 does not support chromium on ubuntu26.04-x64. Not caused by the sync — any push to the site fails until the site's deploy.yml pins `runs-on: ubuntu-24.04` or Playwright is upgraded to a version supporting 26.04. That is a change in the site repo; awaiting the user's call (this repo's rule is never to hand-edit the site's files from this session).

